STRING 510
{
Soulkeeper TD
}

STRING 511
{
The evil Creeps attack and want the Souls, which are inside of the Trees of Souls!! The Trees are since the birth of the earth holy and important for every being. You have to protect your ToS with Towers! You can use special skills of the ToS, which will help you.
Try to be the first player, who reaches the finish!!
-There are 50 Waves
-Every 10th Level is a Boss-Level
-22, 33 and 44 are Invisible
}

STRING 512
{
The Secret Tower
}

STRING 513
{
If you beat the game and you get 1st, 2nd or 3rd Place, you get a combination which you have to type  on your keyboard the next time you play Soulkeeper TD! Then you get a new Special Tower, which makes you different from the players, who didn't win yet! It is not an ultimate imba tower, but it will help you!
}

